HARK! "The Pirate King's Arithmetical Engine"
  or, "In Which Two Numbers are Submitted to the Indignity of Calculation"

(ASIDE, AT SOME LENGTH:
  The Pirate King, though a man of many parts, has always felt
  that his crew lacked a reliable means of division of plunder.
  He has therefore commissioned this arithmetical engine, which
  will take two numbers and subject them to any of the four
  principal operations, as the occasion demands.

  "I am the Pirate King!
   And it is, it is a glorious thing to be a Pirate King!"
   — The Pirates of Penzance

  The Major-General, who knows everything except military matters,
  has certified this calculator as mathematically sound.
END OF ASIDE.)

PRINCIPALS
  PRAY WELCOME first_plunder   AS A FATHOM  ASIDE: the first number
  PRAY WELCOME second_plunder  AS A FATHOM  ASIDE: the second number
  PRAY WELCOME operation       AS A YARN    ASIDE: the chosen operation
  PRAY WELCOME result          AS A FATHOM  ASIDE: the computed result
  PRAY WELCOME another         AS A YARN    ASIDE: whether to continue

ASIDE: -----------------------------------------------------------------------
ASIDE: Functions — the duties of the crew, each assigned his particular role
ASIDE: -----------------------------------------------------------------------

IT IS MY DUTY TO PERFORM add UNDER THE TERMS OF a AND b
  AND SO I FIND SUM OF a AND b
MY DUTY IS DISCHARGED.

IT IS MY DUTY TO PERFORM subtract UNDER THE TERMS OF a AND b
  AND SO I FIND DIFFERENCE OF a AND b
MY DUTY IS DISCHARGED.

IT IS MY DUTY TO PERFORM multiply UNDER THE TERMS OF a AND b
  AND SO I FIND PRODUCT OF a AND b
MY DUTY IS DISCHARGED.

IT IS MY DUTY TO PERFORM divide UNDER THE TERMS OF a AND b
  ALIKE b AND 0.0
  SHOULD IT TRANSPIRE THAT
    QUITE SO.
      BEHOLD "  ERROR: Division by zero is not permitted, even by pirates."
      BEHOLD "         The Sergeant of Police has been notified."
      MY DUTY IS PREMATURELY DISCHARGED.
  SO MUCH FOR THAT.
  AND SO I FIND QUOTIENT OF a AND b
MY DUTY IS DISCHARGED.

ASIDE: -----------------------------------------------------------------------
ASIDE: Main programme — the operation of the engine
ASIDE: -----------------------------------------------------------------------

BEHOLD "=============================================="
BEHOLD "  THE PIRATE KING'S ARITHMETICAL ENGINE"
BEHOLD "  Certified by Major-General Stanley"
BEHOLD "=============================================="
BEHOLD ""

BY A LEGAL FICTION KNOWN AS main_loop

  BEHOLD "Please enter the first number:"
  PRAY TELL first_plunder
  first_plunder IS HENCEFORTH A FATHOM

  BEHOLD "Please enter the second number:"
  PRAY TELL second_plunder
  second_plunder IS HENCEFORTH A FATHOM

  BEHOLD "Please select your operation:"
  BEHOLD "  + (addition, the most honourable)"
  BEHOLD "  - (subtraction, a necessary evil)"
  BEHOLD "  * (multiplication, favoured by the unscrupulous)"
  BEHOLD "  / (division, for equitable distribution of plunder)"
  PRAY TELL operation

  ASIDE: render judgement upon the operation — with appropriate solemnity
  operation
  IN WHICH CAPACITY?
    WHEN ACTING AS "+"
      result IS APPOINTED SUMMON add WITH first_plunder AND second_plunder IF YOU PLEASE.
      BEHOLD WOVEN OF "  " AND first_plunder AND " + " AND second_plunder AND " = " AND result IF YOU PLEASE.
      THAT WILL DO.
    WHEN ACTING AS "-"
      result IS APPOINTED SUMMON subtract WITH first_plunder AND second_plunder IF YOU PLEASE.
      BEHOLD WOVEN OF "  " AND first_plunder AND " - " AND second_plunder AND " = " AND result IF YOU PLEASE.
      THAT WILL DO.
    WHEN ACTING AS "*"
      result IS APPOINTED SUMMON multiply WITH first_plunder AND second_plunder IF YOU PLEASE.
      BEHOLD WOVEN OF "  " AND first_plunder AND " * " AND second_plunder AND " = " AND result IF YOU PLEASE.
      THAT WILL DO.
    WHEN ACTING AS "/"
      SUMMON divide WITH first_plunder AND second_plunder IF YOU PLEASE.
      result IS APPOINTED JUST SO
      ALIKE result AND NAUGHT
      SHOULD IT TRANSPIRE THAT
        OTHERWISE,
          BEHOLD WOVEN OF "  " AND first_plunder AND " / " AND second_plunder AND " = " AND result IF YOU PLEASE.
      SO MUCH FOR THAT.
      THAT WILL DO.
    FAILING ALL OF THE ABOVE,
      BEHOLD "  That operation is unknown to the Pirate King. He is most displeased."
  NOTHING COULD BE MORE SATISFACTORY.

  BEHOLD ""
  BEHOLD "Shall we perform another calculation? (yes/no)"
  BEHOLD "A policeman's lot, as you know, is not a happy one — but the engine stands ready."
  PRAY TELL another

  ALIKE another AND "no"
  SHOULD IT TRANSPIRE THAT
    QUITE SO.
      FREE FROM THIS QUANDARY.
  SO MUCH FOR THAT.

  BEHOLD ""

THE TERM EXPIRES.

BEHOLD ""
BEHOLD "The Pirate King thanks you for your patronage."
BEHOLD "He is, it is a glorious thing, a Pirate King."
BEHOLD "Good day."

FINALE.
